    "name": "luh-sem-data-from-a-parameter-study-on-316l-cucrzr-multi-material-specimens",
    "notes": "This dataset was generated in the context of a parameter study in the paper:\r\n_Supplementary data of \u201cAdditive manufacturing of multi-material parts \u2013 Influence of process parameters on interface formation in in-plane 316L/CuCrZr laser powder bed fusion\"_ \r\n\r\nIt includes SEM data of seven specimens with the following sample numbers: 1, 8, 24, 25, 32, 33, 40.\r\n\r\n* __Materials:__ 316L (Carpenter Additive) and CuCrZr (Eckart TLS GmbH)\r\n* __PBF-LB Machine:__ Aconity MIDI+ equipped with an integrated Aerosint SPD Recoater V1.0\r\n* __Mounting material:__ AB-Zenopox\r\n* __Grinding machine:__ Struers Tegramin-30\r\n* __SEM system:__ Zeiss SUPRA 55 VP\r\n\r\n![Exemplary scanning electron microscopy image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)](https://data.uni-hannover.de/de/dataset/1d4cfae6-31a0-49f0-81d1-6d679e2fcd41/resource/2ae1bdea-56f4-40a9-a41f-9bd7102de35d/download/exemplary_sem_image_sample1.png)\r\nExemplary scanning electron microscopy image of a 316L/CuCrZr multi-material sample (Sample 1)\r\n\r\n### References\r\n\r\nMeyer, I., Oel, M., Ehlers, T., & Lachmayer, R. (2023). *Additive manufacturing of multi-material parts \u2013 Design guidelines for manufacturing of 316L/CuCrZr in laser powder bed fusion*. Heliyon, 9(8), e18301. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2023.e18301\r\n\r\nIna Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025).\u00a0*Additive manufacturing data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens*\u00a0[Data set]. LUIS.\u00a0https://doi.org/10.25835/7p6wv6cg\r\n\r\nIna Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025).\u00a0*\u00b5CT data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens*\u00a0[Data set]. LUIS.\u00a0https://doi.org/10.25835/bi1jbiq9\r\n\r\nIna Meyer, Roland Lachmayer (2025).\u00a0*Light microscopy data from a parameter study on 316L/CuCrZr multi-material specimens*\u00a0[Data set]. LUIS.\u00a0https://doi.org/10.25835/rsjz3w2k\r\n\r\n### Acknowledgments\r\n\r\nThe project \u201d*Additive Fertigung multimaterieller Komponenten zur nachhaltigen Energiewandlung*\u201d was funded by the European Regional Development Fund (ERDF) and the state of Lower Saxony \u2013 Project number ZW 7-87011865.\r\n\r\nThe project \u201d*Major Research Instrumentation for integration of efficient effects in multi-material structural components*\u201d was funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG - German Research Foundation) - Project number 445707542.",
